{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_04_beg","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_04","title":"安魂教堂","storyCode":"GA-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ec7ef37c97e7edab0e7f563abbb7bd76990dbc2fc9baed7c34497e338c8bb1a3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脸色这么差，通宵了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他回来了，我看到了，绝不会认错......那种光，安多恩的源石技艺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......所以这就是你昨天下午突然没了消息的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，他竟然直接找上你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他不是来找我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天带那个混血女孩回大教堂的路上......我遇到了萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种时候？萨卡兹？在拉特兰大街上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没错。我去追萨卡兹，让艾泽尔带那个女孩回大教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我追到法柏尔区边缘......萨卡兹，被安多恩的源石技艺掩护，逃走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于艾泽尔，我以为他昨天就到大教堂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他没来。这是他的终端。贴在一辆使节礼宾车的车底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，那个见习小鬼演技有那么好？把你骗过了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不认为那是演技。但我确实不明白他为什么......难道，安多恩把他也掳走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔，我觉得你需要冷静点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很冷静，我比这八年中的任何一分钟都要冷静！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们始终不肯告诉我，那天我离开之后的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明只是个清剿任务......明明比预想中还要顺利......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是接了一个临时支援......离开了四个小时......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到那个废墟的时候，什么都迟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能和你讲的都讲过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锁与匙到底给了他什么？能让他疯到对蕾缪安动手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个，还真不是我不想告诉你......我也得知道啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔，我们现在在拉特兰，在拉特兰大教堂，这里不是什么卡兹戴尔的野外废墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你该休息一下，菲亚梅塔。要不，我去帮你把年假请了？公证所的年假不用会过期的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在开什么玩笑？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后天就是会议开幕，安多恩带着萨卡兹出现在拉特兰城，掳走了一个混血萨科塔女孩，甚至可能对执行者动了手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我大意了，看那个萨卡兹对法柏尔区的熟悉程度，他们在拉特兰应该已经潜伏很久了......这个疯子到底又打算干什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说真的，冷静点，菲亚梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老家伙已经知道迷途者的消息了，薇尔丽芙也知道。我昨天在大教堂也是工作了的——虽然我不是很喜欢把开会叫做工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总而言之，拉特兰没你想得那么危险。安多恩也只是个萨科塔而已，没有六只眼睛四条胳膊。你要真想对付他，现在去休息两个小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，我们去找蕾缪安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你还没有完全失去理智。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚休息得怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我休息得很好。谢谢你收留我们，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安魂教堂的门永远敞开，只要你不嫌弃这里太过压抑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，生者和死者都会到访这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......此时能有一处容身之所已经很难得了。说起来，塞茜莉亚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你带来的女孩，对吗？姐妹们告诉我，她昨晚睡得很沉，大概是累了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许她度过了太漫长的一天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔哥哥，修士先生，早上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，塞茜莉亚，你好像精神不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......毕竟，今天还有事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我向修士先生拜托了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修士先生告诉我，来到这里的......去世的人，会有和亲人告别的仪式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想和妈妈......好好道个别......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为费莉亚女士办一场葬礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是吗，葬礼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送别远行之人，亦是收拾自己的行囊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会帮忙的，塞茜莉亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再次感谢你，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，本该如此。不如说，这是我的荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这世上最可赞美的，就是践行路途的勇气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她尚且年幼，而与至亲道别的路途，对许多成年人都堪称艰难。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可以进来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是你，你终于来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请进吧，不必客气，她就在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是唱歌的棉花糖姐姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（放下你的铳吧，这只是一次动人的相会罢了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（与大地上千百次动人的相会别无二致。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你果然就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，昨天没来得及......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来想和你多说说话的！但是不知道......为什么大家会打起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的角真的和我爸爸的角长得好像，好漂亮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也想要爸爸的角呢......有点羡慕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼呼，是吗？可你的光环也很漂亮啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会晃得晚上睡不着！虽然看故事书很方便......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你和爸爸是一个地方来的吗？为什么我爸爸不能住在城里？为什么拉特兰没有其他萨卡兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我的名字叫塞茜莉亚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你好，塞茜莉亚。就叫我......罗塞菈吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......修士，萨卡兹为什么会出现在这里？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是啊，萨卡兹......神圣的拉特兰城，从不允许萨卡兹踏足。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那么，塞茜莉亚又是什么人呢？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（走吧，给她们一点空间。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......你们想做什么？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我们......只是在寻找自己的路。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的信徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"先导，早上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思索的信徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"先导，向您致敬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微笑的信徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"先导，祝您健康。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们叫你先导。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不如此自居，你可以称呼我的名字，安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我的兄弟姐妹们而言，如果拥有一个先导能让他们感到安心，获得方向，我愿意尽一份责任，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在想什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个潜伏在拉特兰的异教组织和他们蛊惑人心的领导者，打算在拉特兰精心筹备的会议期间策划一场惊天阴谋，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我们只是敞开大门而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被厌弃的，被损毁的，被侮辱的，被亵渎的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安魂教堂接纳所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，你，我，我们是“天使”，他们不是，属于萨科塔的神殿和圣堂中没有他们的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看他，那个钉棺材的乌萨斯老人，在战争中失去了亲人、朋友、土地、故乡。他能依靠什么，相信什么？他能从哪里获得安慰和救赎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跨越漫长的旅途，他来到拉特兰，来到他偶然从旅行者口中得知的遍洒圣乐和光辉的安乐之乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是这里能给他什么？辉煌的拉特兰城如何安慰这被厄运压得佝偻的异国人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那个正在给草药浇水的卡普里尼女人了吗，因为得罪贵族，背上了荡妇和亵渎者的骂名，挣扎着从被点燃的房子中逃了出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是想要获得平静，或许再奢侈一点，偶尔享受片刻的悠闲和欢愉。——大教堂中的堂皇圣徒们会承认她为姐妹吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对这些人，我们荣耀的拉特兰市民们或许会报以同情的微笑，也许热忱地倾听，甚至慷慨地敞开钱包，展现自己仁慈的美德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但所有这一切——隔岸观火，他们永远只会隔岸观火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于萨卡兹，“被诅咒的魔族佬”，“奸诈残忍的魔族佬”......从未有过选择的“魔族佬”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们与我们的仇恨持续了千百年，自有史可考之日，萨科塔与萨卡兹就相互屠戮。最初的缘由埋没在尘埃，彼此的仇视已成为常理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父子处决另一对父子，姐妹杀死另一双姐妹，萨卡兹以袭击萨科塔的商队为乐，萨科塔以洞穿萨卡兹的胸膛为荣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们尽情塑造着自己眼中的他们，却对他们眼中的自己毫无兴趣，复仇，反击，行为积累为习俗，习俗堆积成传统......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，若你愿意与他们共处一片穹顶之下，你会发现他们的悲喜与我们并无不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为归来欢乐，因离去哭泣，会揶揄朋友，也会羞涩于爱情，有人爱喝酒、爱唱歌，也有人愿意与信仰同行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们到底有多大的歧异与不同？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在拉特兰，即使是那些虔诚笃信的黎博利修士，小心翼翼地遵守每一条戒律，执行每一次仪式，获封为圣贤，晋升为枢机......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教廷也从未真正接纳他们，黎博利们不过是解决俗事的帮手，处理庶务的工具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们没有这一顶光环，他们就不是......呵，“被选中”的萨科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平和美丽、充满欢笑的拉特兰，这份“恩典”，只有我们配得享有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说的......未免......离经叛道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻的执行者，我问你，为什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有萨科塔理当受福？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们知道塞茜莉亚的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多年之前，我就知道了。一个萨科塔和萨卡兹的混血儿，若世上真有恩典，她才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你们现在想掳走塞茜莉亚，是因为使节们的会议？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个会议与我们无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在才来迎接塞茜莉亚，只为了孩子能在母亲身边成长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做完该做的事，我们就会离开拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎很警惕......首先要完成的，是塞茜莉亚母亲的葬礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了吗，前面那片开满野花的地方？那是墓地。明天，费莉亚就会安葬在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若人人死而平等——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理当生也如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_373_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执行者费德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"万国信使阁下，你是否为萨卡兹提供了潜入拉特兰周边的渠道？若属实，我将把你移送至教皇厅有关机构接受问讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_373_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们不必闹得那么僵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"请配合公证所工作，若拒捕，我将依据有关条例暂时褫夺贵方拉特兰公民权益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_373_1","isRemote":false,"text":"基于律法和圣训，我们该如何解释这次相会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_373_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应当解释为一次考验，还是一次迷途呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_373_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抑或，迷途也不过是考验的一部分？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"这是明确的拒捕行为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，看来我们不能和平解决了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_279_excu","aliases":["费德里科"]}]}
